3. An online adaptation scheme that refines the transferred coefficient prior from streaming observations using recursive least squares, without gradient-based retraining during deployment; and

4. Extensive validation in the Verti-Bench simulator [18] and on five distinct physical configurations of the Verti-4-Wheeler platform [6], demonstrating improved performance over state-of-the-art baselines and robust closed-loop trajectory tracking with MPPI in simulation and physical experiments.
